  "description": "Create adorable personalized Christmas decorations with this Christmas Ornament Bundle laser cut file. This festive collection includes four charming layered designs featuring a gingerbread boy, penguin, Santa Claus, and cute reindeer.\nPerfect for creating personalized Christmas ornaments, gift tags, stocking decorations, nursery keepsakes, and handmade holiday gifts. The layered design adds a beautiful 3D effect and works wonderfully with wood, acrylic, or other laser-cutting materials.\nA lovely digital design for Christmas craft projects, holiday markets, and personalized gifts.\n– You will receive 1 ZIP file including:\n+) 4 SVG file\n+) 4 AI file\n+) 4 DWG file\n+) 4 EPS file\n+) 4 DXF file\n+) 4 PDF file\n– Please make sure your software/machine supports all files before purchasing.\n– Files are suitable for Glowforge and other cutting machines.\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• You are purchasing a digital product. We will not send you any physical product.\n• Basic knowledge of your software and how to use digital files with it is required.\nHAPPY SHOPPING !",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Create adorable personalized Christmas decorations with this Christmas Ornament Bundle laser cut file. This festive collection includes four charming layered designs featuring a gingerbread boy, penguin, Santa Claus, and cute reindeer.</p>\n<p>Perfect for creating personalized Christmas ornaments, gift tags, stocking decorations, nursery keepsakes, and handmade holiday gifts. The layered design adds a beautiful 3D effect and works wonderfully with wood, acrylic, or other laser-cutting materials.</p>\n<p>A lovely digital design for Christmas craft projects, holiday markets, and personalized gifts.</p>\n<p>– You will receive 1 ZIP file including:</p>\n<p>+) 4 SVG file<br>\n+) 4 AI file<br>\n+) 4 DWG file<br>\n+) 4 EPS file<br>\n+) 4 DXF file<br>\n+) 4 PDF file</p>\n<p>– Please make sure your software/machine supports all files before purchasing.</p>\n<p>– Files are suitable for Glowforge and other cutting machines.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:</p>\n<p>• You are purchasing a digital product. We will not send you any physical product.</p>\n<p>• Basic knowledge of your software and how to use digital files with it is required.</p>\n<p>HAPPY SHOPPING !</p>",
